{"id":45666,"date":"2025-10-08T08:02:51","date_gmt":"2025-10-08T07:02:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=45666"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:45:11","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:45:11","slug":"trail-run-real-priolo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-run-real-priolo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Run Real Priolo 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Run Real Priolo 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Run Real Priolo 2027<\/strong> (7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de Abril de 2027<\/strong>, no deslumbrante concelho de <strong>Nordeste<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Clube Desportivo e Cultural Juventude Ilha Verde (JIV)<\/strong> em coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Nordeste<\/strong> e o <strong>CDR Nordeste<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 uma das provas mais carism\u00e1ticas da Macaron\u00e9sia, pontu\u00e1vel para os <strong>Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP<\/strong> (S\u00e9rie 150), <strong>ITRA<\/strong> e <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no centro hist\u00f3rico de Nordeste e chegada na Escola Secund\u00e1ria, a prova rainha de <strong>Ultra (49 km)<\/strong> arranca \u00e0s <strong>07h00<\/strong>, seguindo-se o <strong>Trail (30 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Sprint (18 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail (12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (9,35 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h15<\/strong>. Os percursos atravessam as florestas primitivas de Laurissilva, ribeiras e cumeeiras da Serra da Tronqueira \u2014 santu\u00e1rio natural do Priolo, ave end\u00e9mica dos A\u00e7ores \u2014, oferecendo abastecimentos tradicionais, medalha finisher exclusiva, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio micaelense.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 1