ext-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Ativa 9.35 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Abertas:<\/strong> Oficial Lap2Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 limite de vagas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Run Real Priolo 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de Abril de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Nordeste<\/strong>, na Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova integra circuitos oficiais da ATRP e UTMB?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, pontua para os Campeonatos Nacionais da <strong>ATRP<\/strong> (S\u00e9rie 150) e confere pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para o <strong>ITRA<\/strong> e <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios das partidas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Ultra 49 km parte \u00e0s 07h00, o Trail 30 km \u00e0s 08h30, o Trail Sprint 18 km \u00e0s 09h30, o Mini Trail 12 km \u00e0s 10h00 e a Caminhada \u00e0s 10h15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que tipo de terreno passam as provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso decorre na densa floresta laurissilva a\u00e7oriana, linhas de \u00e1gua e cumeadas montanhosas da Serra da Tronqueira e Pico da Vara.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-run-real-priolo-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lap2Go<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Run Real Priolo 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio de Nordeste, Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Nordeste\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"CDC Juventude Ilha Verde e Munic\u00edpio de Nordeste\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Run Real Priolo 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 24 de Abril de 2027 , no concelho de Nordeste , na Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova integra circuitos oficiais da ATRP e UTMB?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, pontua para os Campeona